# Trivy vulnerability suppressions
# Each entry must include a justification.

# ── npm bundled dependencies (not fixable until npm upstream releases a patch) ──
# These CVEs affect picomatch and brace-expansion bundled inside npm itself
# (usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/node_modules/...), NOT our project dependencies.
# Our project deps were already patched via Dependabot PRs #32-#34.
# No version of npm (up to 11.13.0) ships fixed versions of these transitive deps.
# Re-evaluate when npm >11.12.1 is released.

